WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:48.950
Someone once said:

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:53.960
There are yellow goldfish that 
taste like juicy gyoza...

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:56.960
Gyozagoldfish!

00:01:58.060 --> 00:02:03.900
There are tulips the flavor of 
thick, sweet, delicious pudding

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:06.730
that bloom profusely in flowering fields...

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:08.670
Tulipudding!

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:12.470
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:17.480
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:22.350
The wealthy Buono sponsored 
the Gourmet King Championship.

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:24.150
Whoever brings food that Buono's partner,

00:02:24.150 --> 00:02:26.150
a Seven-Colored Nessie named Chris,

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:29.090
will eat, will win 1 billion yen!

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:32.360
Gourmet Hunters gathered with the 
finest ingredients they could find.

00:02:32.930 --> 00:02:34.830
Meanwhile, Toriko and the 
other Heavenly Kings set out

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:36.060
to locate ingredients they have in mind.

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:40.030
Will someone be able to make Chris eat?

00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:43.840
It's a serious showdown between 
the Gourmet Hunter Heavenly Kings!

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:50.280
Bonding Dish! Partners Are Forever!

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:57.320
W-What is this?!

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:58.850
It's the first time I've seen one.

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:05.460
Sharkbox Turtle (Amphibious 
Beast) Capture Level 32

00:02:58.850 --> 00:03:02.020
A Capture Level 32 Sharkbox Turtle...

00:03:02.020 --> 00:03:05.520
Who would've guessed the Grand 
Berries grow right on his turf?!

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:08.460
I'm not quite as surprised...

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:10.900
I'm not here to make a shambles of your den!

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:13.570
I just want you to share the Grand Berries!

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:18.240
I'd rather not fight, but 
there's nothing else for it!

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:19.370
Komatsu!

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:21.070
I know!

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:23.610
I'm used to the drill by 
now! I'm hiding, see?!

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:24.880
Ah. So you are...

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:32.720
What the...?!

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:41.990
Knife!

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:55.140
This thing is like, swimming 
under the surface of the ground!

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:56.770
This is gonna be a tough one!

00:04:00.140 --> 00:04:01.810
Toriko-san!

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:19.560
The Milk Whale is totally 
terrified by those jerks!

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:21.460
Hurry up and do something, Bro!

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:24.330
Easy for you to say. If I'm not careful,

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:27.870
stress could make the Milk Whale 
stop putting out milk altogether!

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:29.410
Then what are you gonna do?!

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:32.140
I should be able to handle things

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:34.980
if I can just get them within the 
perimeter of my Dining Kitchen...

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:39.880
I see...

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:41.420
Yes, I can do that...

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:43.950
Bro, where you goin'?!

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:46.050
Leave it to me!

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:58.130
Poison Dressing!

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:04.940
Kiss!

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:11.650
Hmm, they've been attacking as a swarm...

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:13.310
Huh?

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:15.980
That's...

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:17.290
A figure-eight dance!

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:20.990
Supposedly, honeybees do a figure-eight dance

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:23.060
to alert their fellow bees 
of a place with flowers.

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:27.530
Is the leader of the Honey Dragons telling 
the others what to do through dance?

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:32.000
If that is the case...

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:32.930
Kiss!

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:44.340
All right! Now!

00:05:53.690 --> 00:05:54.950
I was right...

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:56.990
If the figure-eight dance is disrupted,

00:05:56.990 --> 00:05:58.690
the movements of the swarm become chaotic!

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:01.660
Now I just have to take care of the leader...

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:05.700
Poison Cannon!

00:06:12.270 --> 00:06:15.410
My apologies. But I made sure 
to give you a weak dose.

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:17.540
You'll be back in the air in no time.

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:28.390
I'm just going to borrow some of your honey.

00:06:34.630 --> 00:06:36.590
What the heck are you doing, Bro?!

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:38.460
Bringing up sand from the bottom of the sea

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:40.670
to corner that Chomp Urchin.

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:46.270
Some dolphins kick up sand 
to trap and prey on fish.

00:06:46.270 --> 00:06:50.980
I'm using the same principle to choke off 
the Chomp Urchin's field of activity.

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:54.710
I've been waiting for you.

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:56.780
Spatula!

00:07:02.850 --> 00:07:07.360
See, by driving the Chomp Urchin 
away, the Shrimp Fly follows.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.660
Not too shabby, Bro!

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:15.100
More like "wonderful"... 
"Stupendous"... "Special", right?!

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:17.300
Now, Milk Whale.

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:20.900
Just relax and spout out 
some of that beautiful milk!

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:26.910
A milk geyser?!

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:29.410
Some people call it a "Milky Wave"!

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:32.780
And taking a bath in it makes 
the skin as smooth as velvet!

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:37.150
Fine, but first we've gotta feed 
it to that Seven-Colored Nessie!

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:42.660
Well, so far Chris-san hasn't even had 
a nibble of the various offerings,

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:47.160
so everyone here is 
feasting on the leftovers.

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:50.300
What are we gonna get to eat next?

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:51.870
I can't wait!

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:53.740
Is this why we came to the event?

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:57.370
Okay! What's the next hopeful ingredient?

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:58.910
How 'bout this?!

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:04.150
A wine flower, which produces the 
finest vintages of wine nectar!

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:06.780
So what does Chris-san think?

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:09.650
The Seven-Colored Nessie doesn't 
have even a gram of interest!

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:11.150
Why, you...

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:12.450
So frustrating...

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:14.790
I'll drink to that!

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:19.560
Oh, that Tonbi...

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:21.560
It's Zonge!

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:24.200
What is it?

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:26.630
Chris... Why won't you eat?

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:30.840
Um... What did Chris eat before?

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:34.240
Well, I used to share 
everything I ate with him

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:36.710
and he had no problem eating it, but now...

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:39.680
You're worried too, huh, Kuruppo?

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:42.450
I can see you two are close.

00:08:43.180 --> 00:08:46.250
Chris and I have always been together.

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:50.320
Ever since we first met in the 
forest, when I was a kid...

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:53.460
Chris was in a weakened state...

00:08:54.360 --> 00:09:00.500
I lost my family at an early age, but 
I was never lonely with Chris around.

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:02.240
It'll be all right!

00:09:02.670 --> 00:09:05.040
Toriko and the others are still out hunting,

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:06.610
so I can give extra special assurance

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:08.310
that Chris will get healthy again!

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:12.210
Right...

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:16.180
Flying Knife!

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:26.830
Yeesh! How hard is that snapper's shell?!

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:29.730
And it hasn't run out of steam either!

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:34.430
Ever since it went on the warpath, 
it hasn't stopped moving once!

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.170
Hasn't stopped moving?

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:40.940
I get it!

00:09:40.940 --> 00:09:42.810
Komatsu, you're a genius!

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:46.510
Spiked Punch!

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:52.150
Flying Knife!

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:55.290
But I thought Knife doesn't work!

00:09:58.220 --> 00:10:02.660
I see! You used Knife to 
flip it over onto its back!

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:06.060
Yep. I remembered something about sharks.

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:11.440
They need to keep swimming to breathe 
in oxygen through the water.

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:14.810
And if they stop moving, they can't breathe.

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:18.880
This one also kept moving 
in order to breathe.

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:23.010
So all I had to do was stop it from 
moving to render it weak as a kitten!

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:24.380
I see.

00:10:25.050 --> 00:10:26.480
Sorry 'bout that, big fella.

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:31.720
Would you mind sharing a few Grand Berries?

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:40.560
Grand Berry, the favorite 
food of all dragons...

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:43.830
This sweet-and-sour scent... 
I can't get enough!

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:47.040
Toriko-san! You're not supposed to eat it!

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:54.710
E-Everyone, Sunny, one of the Four 
Kings, has returned with an ingredient!

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:00.480
Here, beautiful milk from the Milk Whale.

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:02.080
Don't hold back, just drink up!

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:09.490
Oh! This is the first time Chris-san 
has shown an interest in an ingredient!

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:11.330
Looks like I win.

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:14.800
But Chris-san isn't tasting it!

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:17.670
W-Wait! It's incredibly delicious!

00:11:17.670 --> 00:11:19.740
It's also totally great for your skin!

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:21.640
What?

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:23.910
Don't get our hopes up!

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:26.510
Chris...

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:29.410
I'm up next!

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:33.480
Whoa! Swooping in from the sky...

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:36.350
It's another of the Four Kings, Coco!

00:11:36.350 --> 00:11:39.490
Darn it! Stealing my thunder again!

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:47.460
My ingredient is honey from the Honey Dragon.

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:48.230
Look!

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:59.310
Ooh, it looks like Chris-san is interested...

00:11:59.970 --> 00:12:00.840
Huh?

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:03.540
But the Seven-Colored Nessie 
refuses to taste that, too!

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:05.710
This honey isn't going to work either?

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:12.350
Leave it to me!

00:12:13.190 --> 00:12:17.820
Oh! Our last hope, Toriko, is here!

00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:21.230
I bet Chris was waiting for this all along!

00:12:21.230 --> 00:12:26.100
A Seven-Colored Nessie's favorite 
ingredient is these Grand Berries!

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:28.330
Go on, dig in!

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:41.310
The final ingredient, from 
Toriko, one of the Four Kings,

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:43.750
and Chris-san didn't try that either!

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:45.750
We all struck out?! Oh, for cryin' out loud!

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:49.620
Y-You... You call yourselves the Four Kings?!

00:12:57.360 --> 00:12:58.560
Chris...

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:02.230
Is there really nothing 
here that you want to eat?!

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:06.500
Huh? I wonder what's wrong...

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:08.970
Chris seems to be bothered by something...

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:18.080
Chris! What's wrong?!

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:22.750
No!

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:24.320
Chris!!

00:13:35.270 --> 00:13:37.800
Stop, Chris!

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:39.600
Toriko!

00:13:43.310 --> 00:13:46.380
It doesn't look like it was attacking Rin.

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:47.610
It's...

00:13:47.610 --> 00:13:49.710
It looks like it's pleading for something.

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:55.320
Chris is pleading for something...

00:13:55.590 --> 00:13:59.390
Although he seems really 
interested in the ingredients

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:02.960
Toriko and the others 
brought, as well as Rin...

00:14:04.330 --> 00:14:05.500
Toriko-san!

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:06.860
Coco-san!

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:07.900
Sunny-san!

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:12.440
Will you let me handle 
these three ingredients?

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:16.040
I have something I'd like 
to try and cook with them!

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:19.180
A dish that will satisfy 
the Seven Colored Nessie?

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:19.940
Yes!

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:24.480
Okay, Komatsu!

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:29.950
Make something that'll satisfy Chris, 
and lead us to the legendary fruit!

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:31.850
Right!

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:35.190
Matsu, if you screw up 
I'm never forgiving you.

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:37.560
Komatsu-kun, I'm expecting 
good things from you.

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:39.230
Leave it to me!

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:44.770
Chef Komatsu is now cooking in 
the kitchen behind the stage!

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:49.200
These three ingredients weren't 
collected just by coincidence.

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:54.210
I'm sure that the ingredients are showing 
me the way, just like happened before.

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:57.080
I'll listen to the voice of the ingredients!

00:14:58.310 --> 00:15:00.410
Will Komatsu-kun be okay?

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:02.850
Worry isn't going to help, you know?

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:04.620
It's in Komatsu's hands now.

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:05.620
All we can do is wait.

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:12.060
All finished!

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:16.460
It's a parfait I made using the Grand 
Berries, the milk from the Milk Whale,

00:15:16.460 --> 00:15:18.730
and the honey from the Honey Dragons!

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:20.670
It looks super delicious!

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:21.800
Oh, my!

00:15:21.800 --> 00:15:24.970
Chef Komatsu's dish is complete!

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:28.810
Feeding a parfait to a dragon?

00:15:28.810 --> 00:15:31.680
I've never heard of an RPG 
with a plot like that...

00:15:31.680 --> 00:15:34.450
Komatsu-kun, why a parfait?

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:39.220
Chris acted oddly when it saw 
Rin-san eating that parfait.

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:40.650
So I thought, maybe...

00:15:40.650 --> 00:15:41.720
Parfait?

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:42.460
Here.

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:45.990
Please feed Chris yourself...

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:55.200
Chris...

00:15:56.170 --> 00:15:57.970
Come on, eat.

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:12.650
Chris ate it!

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:15.190
Chris-san ate the parfait!

00:16:17.190 --> 00:16:18.220
They did it!

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:19.290
They did it!

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:23.530
Chris, I remember now!

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:27.530
The first meal we had together was a parfait!

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:34.170
It's starting to shine like crazy!

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:36.940
It must be because Chris is 
intaking the three main nutrients,

00:16:36.940 --> 00:16:40.710
carbohydrates, protein, and fat, in 
large amounts and superb quality.

00:16:40.710 --> 00:16:43.550
Now that I think about it, 
"parfait" means "perfect".

00:16:43.550 --> 00:16:47.990
With Matsu's cooking, the Nessie gets 
ingredients from land, sea, and air...

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:50.850
The nutritional value is perfectly balanced.

00:16:50.850 --> 00:16:53.560
Just like the name says, 
it's a perfect desert.

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:56.430
Aww... It's just because I 
had such great ingredients.

00:16:56.430 --> 00:16:58.200
A desert from happy memories, huh?

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:02.670
Everyone... Thank you very much!

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:09.540
Perhaps Chris had decided what was on the 
menu for his final meal with you, Buono...

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:11.170
Final?

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:15.710
Chris!

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:30.630
Incredible! Chris-san had grown wings!

00:17:32.060 --> 00:17:33.360
Beautiful!

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:35.600
It looks like it's time to leave the nest...

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:36.770
Leave the nest?

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:39.770
When the Seven Colored Nessie 
matures into adulthood,

00:17:39.770 --> 00:17:41.700
they are said to have seven colored wings.

00:17:42.340 --> 00:17:46.580
I had thought it strange that it 
didn't have wings even at its size.

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:49.510
I bet it got the wings 'cause 
it eat such nutritious food!

00:17:49.510 --> 00:17:51.110
Leave the nest?

00:17:51.780 --> 00:17:53.680
Part with Chris?

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:56.050
No, I don't want that!

00:17:57.290 --> 00:17:58.650
We'll always be together!

00:17:59.590 --> 00:18:01.760
We'll be together forever!

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:08.200
Chris has decided to go out and live in 
the natural world, with its own strength.

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:11.300
That is the happiest place for Chris.

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:16.800
All living things have a time when 
they have to go out on their own.

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:19.370
But...

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:22.080
Just because you'll be apart, 
family is still family, right?

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:52.540
I understand...

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:55.240
I'll try my best on my own, too.

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:05.720
It flew!

00:19:08.150 --> 00:19:09.360
Chris...

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:26.610
Hair Net!

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:28.870
That's...

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:30.340
A Glow Apple!

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:36.010
There is a legend that if you 
raise a Seven Colored Nessie,

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:38.850
a "Grow Up"-ple will sprout as proof!

00:19:38.850 --> 00:19:41.220
So this is the legendary fruit...

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:46.720
Thank you, Chris!

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:53.630
The sign of love rising into a red sky 
invites one to the legendary fruit...

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:55.870
Just like the legend says, yes?

00:19:57.700 --> 00:20:00.470
Don't worry, Chris'll make it alone.

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:05.340
Yes, you're right.

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:09.610
Okay!

00:20:09.610 --> 00:20:13.620
Time to eat this Glow Apple 
to honor Chris's big day!

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:14.790
Okay!

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:16.020
Everyone, let's eat!

00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:22.190
Now then, it's time to taste the 
legendary fruit, the Glow Apple!

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:24.830
What? The broadcast is over already?

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:26.600
W-Wait!

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:30.230
I give thanks for this 
world's great bounty...

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:32.240
Let's eat!

00:20:34.340 --> 00:20:35.670
Yum!

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:38.240
So crunchy and delicious!

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:41.380
Like an apple with plenty 
of honey, a La France,

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:43.610
and a ripe mango all wrapped into one!

00:20:44.310 --> 00:20:46.150
This sweetness!

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:47.720
Yum!

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:49.590
So delicious!

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:52.250
Komatsu's parfait is super delicious, too!

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:53.490
Of course!

00:20:53.490 --> 00:20:55.320
The whipped cream of the parfait

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:59.630
is made with the milk from the Milk Whale, 
and the Seven Colored Nessie ate it...

00:20:59.630 --> 00:21:02.260
Therefore, I am the winner of the contest!

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:03.030
Hey!

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:06.740
It's clear that the main ingredient 
of that parfait is the Grand Berry!

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:08.170
That means I win!

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:10.670
I think Toriko won, too!

00:21:10.670 --> 00:21:12.740
But we captured the milk together!

00:21:12.740 --> 00:21:15.740
Ah, why did they have to end 
the broadcast in the middle...

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:19.480
Delicious!

00:21:20.520 --> 00:21:22.020
Hey, Buono!

00:21:22.020 --> 00:21:25.650
If you don't eat, there won't 
be any Glow Apple left!

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:27.990
Right!

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:33.090
Sabrina

00:21:34.160 --> 00:21:36.300
Pa-pa-pa-para

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:38.170
Sabrina

00:21:40.100 --> 00:21:47.240
Rainy day, danced down on the night city

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:54.150
You had deep red lipstick on you

00:21:54.150 --> 00:21:57.920
Like you were toyed with

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:01.350
Like you were tasted

00:22:01.350 --> 00:22:08.460
A solitary silhouette seen through the glass

00:22:08.460 --> 00:22:15.200
One day, one day... Search for true love

00:22:15.200 --> 00:22:22.240
Even if hurt by the lies going around town

00:22:22.240 --> 00:22:27.010
Rottening fruit

00:22:27.010 --> 00:22:28.580
Sabrina

00:22:31.650 --> 00:22:33.720
Gourmet News!

00:22:34.420 --> 00:22:36.190
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:36.190 --> 00:22:40.090
Today, we're going to introduce 
another heaping helping

00:22:40.090 --> 00:22:43.460
of winners from the Toriko Anime 
Original Monsters Contest!

00:22:43.760 --> 00:22:45.660
Gyouzafish!

00:22:45.660 --> 00:22:47.330
Tulipudding!

00:22:47.330 --> 00:22:49.330
Wineflower!

00:22:49.330 --> 00:22:51.470
And the Sharkbox Turtle!

00:22:51.470 --> 00:22:54.370
They're all a huge helping 
of wonderful ingredients!

00:22:54.910 --> 00:22:57.140
The wineflower is the best!

00:22:57.140 --> 00:22:58.140
Hey!

00:22:58.140 --> 00:23:00.750
Get outta here! Don't get 
in the way of the news!

00:23:01.110 --> 00:23:02.710
Pardon me!

00:23:02.710 --> 00:23:04.680
N-Now, on to the next story...

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:09.120
The head of the IGO makes his appearance!

00:23:09.290 --> 00:23:11.720
President Ichiryu and Toriko engage in a friendly hug...

00:23:11.720 --> 00:23:14.290
...Wait, no, it's a conversation with punches!?

00:23:14.760 --> 00:23:17.530
White Hot! Toriko vs. the IGO President!

00:23:17.530 --> 00:23:19.360
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
